# Base URL of the backend API (no trailing slash needed).
#
# Set     -> the Work Board loads tasks and employees from the API and saves card moves.
# Unset   -> the Work Board runs on the built-in mock data in App.jsx (what Vercel does today,
#            since the API is not deployed yet).
#
# Copy to .env (untracked) to use the local backend:
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
